#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:5
msgid "Element settings"
msgstr "元素设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:10
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech elements settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:13
msgid "Collection settings"
msgstr "收藏设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:15
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows choosing the path from the `QET (Common)`_ and `User`_ "
"element collection. The path from `User Title Block`_ collection can also be"
" chosen. The collections directory can be at the local Hard Disk, common "
"users, or at local servers, common for companies."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许从 `QET (Common) <QET (Common)_>`_ 和 `User <User_>`_ "
"元素收藏中选择路径。 也可以从 `User Title Block <User Title Block_>`_ 收藏中选择路径。 "
"收藏目录可以在本地的硬盘，普通用户，或本地服务器中选择，对于公司来说是常见的 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:19
msgid ""
"The default element collection paths depend on the installation settings "
"chosen during the installation process."
msgstr "默认元件集合路径取决于安装过程中选择的安装设置。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst:22
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_element.rst
msgid "QET collection"
msgstr "QET 收藏"

